 Postgres password: ${PG_PASSWORD}

 DNS requirement:   A records for ${CODER_DOMAIN} and *.${CODER_DOMAIN} -> ${MINIKUBE_IP}
 Work dir kept at:  ${WORKDIR}

 Rotate the admin password after first login. Store the Postgres password in
 your secrets manager; it is also in secret/${NAMESPACE}/coder-db.
==============================================================================
EOF
